Package: libgirara-gtk3-4
Version: @DEB_GIRARA_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://pwmt.org/projects/girara/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libpango-1.0-0, libjson-glib-1.0-0
Description: minimalistic GTK3 user-interface library - runtime
 girara is a small library that implements a user interface focusing on
 a command-line/statusbar/inputbar layout. It is the GTK3 UI toolkit used by
 the zathura document viewer. This package contains the shared library.
